            "review_text": "Cassie Babineau\n3 contributions\n1\nMy experience with Vietnamsese Hotpot\nApr 2024 • Friends\nThe experience here is absolutely fantasic ! The seating arrangenmetn and the ambiance of the place truly creat a special atmosphere, adding to the enjoyment of the meal. I decided to try two types of hotpot - and the result was perfection ! the flavors of each dish were and delicious, making the dining experience truly enjoyable. Moreover, the service from the staff was incredibly attentive and friendly. I can't thank them enough, and I'm very excited to come back again !\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nI would like to see more exquisite desert options.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 8, 2024\nLinh.kitchen Restaurant\nWe appreciate your positive feedback on our culinary offerings! We look forward to the opportunity to cater to you again in the future\nWritten April 8, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
